---
Default synth preset selected in virtual keyboard.

Ensure a synth preset is loaded by default so the virtual keyboard
produces sound immediately without manually selecting a preset.

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] On startup, synth tracks have a default preset loaded (preset 0)
- [ ] Virtual keyboard produces sound immediately
- [ ] Preset name displayed in synth editor

## Test Plan
- [ ] Launch app, click virtual keyboard keys, verify sound output
- [ ] Verify preset name shown in editor matches loaded preset
